these three callback fields today, so this is correct as written — but the function
hardcodes that shape with no note of the assumption. If a future mongo-driver
release adds a fourth callback, it would silently not be chained, the same
"silently dropped" failure mode this PR exists to fix for `Monitor` itself. A short
note makes that assumption visible to the next person touching this function.

